            "type": "game",
            "name": "Hero of the Kingdom II",
            "steam_appid": 346560,
            "required_age": "10",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your serene fairytale sanctuary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where charming classic isometric design meets undisturbed relaxation. Experience a <strong>lovely adventuring RPG</strong> where failure, death, and frustration simply do not exist. This game serves as a stress-free sanctuary—the perfect retreat to unwind after a long, demanding day. Step into a picturesque land where time stands still, gently moving forward only when you decide to act. Discover the heartwarming joy of helping those in need, and watch as your good deeds gradually heal the surrounding world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/346560/extras/b2befac4dc9e200ae8cee0a0d307c33b.avif?t=1788190687\" width=520 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue your beloved sister from pirates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After facing many hardships, you and your sister finally found a safe haven in a quiet fishing village. However, your peaceful life is disrupted when pirates raid the humble coast and take your sister away to unknown lands. Left with no other choice, you must leave the familiar mainland behind and embark on a wholesome journey to bring her home. Along this path, it isn't just your gear that will aid you, but a sharp mind, a willingness to learn, and a compassionate heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/346560/extras/f3e1e554adc7c92deb47eedbf74ffacc.avif?t=1788190687\" width=520 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set sail and explore new horizons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey no longer ends at the shore. With deeply accessible point-and-click controls, you will intuitively gather supplies and search for hundreds of useful items hidden within the detailed scenery. Pack your backpack wisely and plan your next steps to build a ship and experience the boundless freedom of the open sea. Unlock paths to tropical islands, explore mysterious caves, and uncover hidden secrets—learn the patient art of opening old chests or dive into the deep blue for rare pearls. Every little obstacle you overcome provides a highly rewarding and gratifying sense of achievement, bringing you one step closer to your sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/346560/extras/581d3446451a140f4a2c43dc946879b0.avif?t=1788190687\" width=520 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you on your journey</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lovely adventure:</strong> Beautiful isometric graphics that immediately immerse you in a picturesque world full of detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time in your hands:</strong> Enjoy the journey entirely at your own pacing, free from stressful time limits or the need for quick reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom on the open sea:</strong> Peaceful exploration of diverse islands, cozy fishing towns, and mysterious coves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gratifying progress:</strong> Experience the deeply rewarding feeling of watching the world heal and blossom right before your eyes through your good deeds and clever trading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-click accessibility:</strong> Comfortable and clean controls—you can navigate the entire journey using just a mouse or touch. Perfect for a relaxing session with a warm cup of tea.</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your serene fairytale sanctuary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where charming classic isometric design meets undisturbed relaxation. Experience a <strong>lovely adventuring RPG</strong> where failure, death, and frustration simply do not exist. This game serves as a stress-free sanctuary—the perfect retreat to unwind after a long, demanding day. Step into a picturesque land where time stands still, gently moving forward only when you decide to act. Discover the heartwarming joy of helping those in need, and watch as your good deeds gradually heal the surrounding world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/346560/extras/b2befac4dc9e200ae8cee0a0d307c33b.avif?t=1788190687\" width=520 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue your beloved sister from pirates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After facing many hardships, you and your sister finally found a safe haven in a quiet fishing village. However, your peaceful life is disrupted when pirates raid the humble coast and take your sister away to unknown lands. Left with no other choice, you must leave the familiar mainland behind and embark on a wholesome journey to bring her home. Along this path, it isn't just your gear that will aid you, but a sharp mind, a willingness to learn, and a compassionate heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/346560/extras/f3e1e554adc7c92deb47eedbf74ffacc.avif?t=1788190687\" width=520 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set sail and explore new horizons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey no longer ends at the shore. With deeply accessible point-and-click controls, you will intuitively gather supplies and search for hundreds of useful items hidden within the detailed scenery. Pack your backpack wisely and plan your next steps to build a ship and experience the boundless freedom of the open sea. Unlock paths to tropical islands, explore mysterious caves, and uncover hidden secrets—learn the patient art of opening old chests or dive into the deep blue for rare pearls. Every little obstacle you overcome provides a highly rewarding and gratifying sense of achievement, bringing you one step closer to your sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/346560/extras/581d3446451a140f4a2c43dc946879b0.avif?t=1788190687\" width=520 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you on your journey</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lovely adventure:</strong> Beautiful isometric graphics that immediately immerse you in a picturesque world full of detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time in your hands:</strong> Enjoy the journey entirely at your own pacing, free from stressful time limits or the need for quick reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom on the open sea:</strong> Peaceful exploration of diverse islands, cozy fishing towns, and mysterious coves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gratifying progress:</strong> Experience the deeply rewarding feeling of watching the world heal and blossom right before your eyes through your good deeds and clever trading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-click accessibility:</strong> Comfortable and clean controls—you can navigate the entire journey using just a mouse or touch. Perfect for a relaxing session with a warm cup of tea.</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Experience a lovely adventuring RPG. Build a ship and set sail across sunny islands to rescue your beloved sister from pirates. Explore picturesque lands, lend a helping hand to those in need, and enjoy a wholesome journey at your own pace.",
